  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Loud Thunder Hall a girl frowns, covers her ears, and threatens Nu Er Gu that if he uses thunder sound again she will turn him into a toad. By bloodline seniority she is Nu Er Gu’s great-aunt despite a little-girl appearance. She is very powerful and has a trump card immortal killer move tested on Nu Er Gu since he was young, leaving him deep trauma and fear. She tells him not to stand out, because Yao tribe, Guan tribe, and Liu tribe are nearer to Chu Sect and Bai Zu tribe. Gong Wan Ting greets her as little sister Nu Er Qian. She judges Yao Yuan Ying gentle, not proficient in fighting and killing, but specialized in healing. Nu Er tribe sends her and Nu Er Gu as main forces: he is erratic and aggressive, she is stable, experienced, and reliable, and she can restrain him. The final decision for Nu Er tribe is in her hands.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
